aragraph\" >The flight model supports a radio controller, a gamepad or a keyboard. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic mode</strong> - full physics on a radio controller or gamepad, the way real FPV flies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple mode</strong> - keyboard and mouse. The drone holds its altitude, and there's a boost when you need speed. Easy controls for newcomers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online co-op missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other pilots and run combat missions together. Coordinate your approaches, split the targets, and cover each other's strikes. You can even join a mission that's already underway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295810/extras/0d6673b36323e29bbe603ff87a0ec497.poster.avif?t=1787140854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295810/extras/0d6673b36323e29bbe603ff87a0ec497.webm?t=1787140854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295810/extras/0d6673b36323e29bbe603ff87a0ec497.mp4?t=1787140854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your own missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The built-in mission editor lets you design your own combat scenarios. Place the targets, set up enemy defenses and EW, and shape the battlefield the way you want to fly it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295810/extras/dfe77e1b645406d5f63ac4ce6fe21991.poster.avif?t=1787140854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_